{"id":"2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved","date":"2026-11-20","topic":"markets","region":"americas","headline":"Christmas Eve Funding Saved Tesla and SpaceX in 2008","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elon_Musk"},"accent":"au","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 2008, Elon Musk lost almost all his money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t1-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.28,"times":[0.0,0.24,1.66,1.84,2.3,2.76,3.22,3.64,3.92]},{"text":"His first space ships failed to reach space.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":2.83,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":3.63,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,0.76,1.12,1.58,1.88,2.06]},{"text":"A new ship reached space in September that year.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":2.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.48,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.54,0.84,1.3,1.62,2.22,2.48]},{"text":"A space group gave his business much needed money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.97,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.78,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.7,0.96,1.2,1.54,1.96,2.42]},{"text":"Other people gave Tesla money on December 24.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.39,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.62,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.38,0.7,1.08,1.5,1.78,2.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":94,"core1800":6,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":0},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"In 2008,","title":"Time Modifier at Start","note":"Prepositional phrases indicating time often appear at the beginning of a sentence to establish context. They modify the entire main action as an adverbial modifier."},{"i":3,"focus":"gave his business much needed money.","title":"Double Object Construction","note":"The verb 'gave' takes two objects here: 'his business' (indirect object receiving the action) and 'much needed money' (direct object being given). This creates an S-V-O-O pattern."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 2008, Elon Musk ran two young businesses that needed money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","S","V","O"],"dur":5.3,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":6.57,"times":[0.0,0.24,1.62,1.88,2.24,2.66,3.06,3.36,3.82,4.3,4.58]},{"text":"SpaceX built space ships, but the first tests failed completely.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","S","S","V","M"],"dur":4.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.61,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.98,1.24,1.98,2.18,2.26,2.52,2.86,3.46]},{"text":"The next ship reached space in September, so leaders were happy.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","S","V","C"],"dur":3.77,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":4.71,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.6,0.94,1.3,1.64,2.7,2.76,3.02,3.3]},{"text":"NASA signed a huge money deal with SpaceX in December.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.89,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.76,0.86,1.26,1.58,1.94,2.16,2.5,2.88]},{"text":"Investors gave Tesla cash on December 24 to pay workers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":6.29,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.72,1.0,1.52,1.9,2.06,2.52,3.12,3.28]},{"text":"Musk used his last cash and borrowed money for his rent.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":4.45,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.54,0.84,1.2,1.62,2.04,2.28,2.68,3.0,3.14]}],"bands":{"core1000":80,"core1800":11,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"that needed money.","title":"Subject Relative Clause","note":"The relative pronoun 'that' replaces 'two young businesses' and functions as the subject inside the descriptive clause. It connects directly to the verb 'needed'."},{"i":4,"focus":"to pay workers.","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"An infinitive phrase starting with 'to' shows the goal or intention behind an action. Here it explains why the investors provided cash to Tesla."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 2008, Elon Musk ran two new companies that almost closed forever.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","S","M","V","M"],"dur":6.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.99,"times":[0.0,0.24,1.62,1.84,2.24,2.62,3.06,3.38,3.86,4.24,4.58,5.18]},{"text":"His space firm, SpaceX, launched three test rockets that failed to reach space.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":5.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.31,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.28,1.02,1.92,2.16,2.74,3.1,3.42,3.8,4.1,4.4,4.6]},{"text":"Fortunately, a fourth rocket reached orbit, which is the flight path around Earth.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t3-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","O","S","V","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.66,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":8.08,"times":[0.0,0.74,0.8,1.12,1.46,1.88,2.84,2.9,3.02,3.14,3.34,3.74,4.06]},{"text":"Following that success, NASA signed a $1.6 billion contract with SpaceX in December.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.45,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.44,1.3,1.42,1.94,2.25,3.02,3.6,4.36,4.7,5.0,5.46]},{"text":"Meanwhile, investors provided Tesla with money on December 24 to pay its workers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t3-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.3,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":7.7,"times":[0.0,0.6,1.0,1.52,1.92,2.26,2.56,2.86,3.04,3.64,4.14,4.32,4.54]},{"text":"Musk has explained that he spent his last money and borrowed rent cash.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","V","O","O"],"dur":4.47,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.72,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.34,0.7,1.0,1.1,1.32,1.58,1.92,2.38,2.72,3.02,3.42]}],"bands":{"core1000":72,"core1800":11,"ngsl":3,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":12},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":", which is the flight path around Earth.","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"Introduced by ', which', this clause provides non-essential definition or explanation about 'orbit'. It cannot use 'that' because of the preceding comma."},{"i":5,"focus":"has explained","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The helper verb 'has' combined with 'explained' forms the present perfect tense. It links a past statement to the present topic of discussion."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"During the economic downturn of 2008, both SpaceX and Tesla were facing financial ruin.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O"],"dur":6.97,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":8.13,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.54,0.76,1.5,1.78,3.18,3.38,3.72,4.42,4.72,5.16,5.5,6.1]},{"text":"SpaceX had attempted three rocket launches that failed before achieving success on its fourth try.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.95,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":8.24,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.68,0.9,1.5,1.86,2.28,2.54,2.84,3.46,4.06,4.42,4.8,4.92,5.18]},{"text":"After that success, a $1.6 billion contract was awarded to SpaceX by NASA in December.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.53,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.06,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.42,1.36,1.62,2.26,2.78,3.54,3.86,4.24,4.44,4.68,5.18,5.48,5.88]},{"text":"A contract is a formal written agreement to perform work in exchange for payment.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.44,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":5.87,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.34,0.68,0.76,1.08,1.48,1.96,2.3,2.56,2.96,3.24,3.46,3.84]},{"text":"Meanwhile, the electric car company Tesla was struggling to pay salary costs to its employees.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.14,"times":[0.0,0.76,0.84,1.12,1.52,1.96,2.28,2.78,3.16,3.42,3.62,3.92,4.34,4.7,4.82]},{"text":"Investors agreed to provide funding on December 24, just hours before paychecks were due.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","C"],"dur":5.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":8.46,"times":[0.0,0.44,0.74,0.94,1.18,1.62,1.9,2.12,3.24,3.5,3.82,4.34,4.86,5.04]},{"text":"Musk reported that he had invested his final personal savings and borrowed money for rent.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":5.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":6.8,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.54,0.8,0.94,1.06,1.4,1.68,2.08,2.44,3.04,3.62,3.84,4.28,4.5]}],"bands":{"core1000":76,"core1800":11,"ngsl":4,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"had attempted","title":"Past Perfect Tense","note":"Using 'had' with the past participle 'attempted' places this action prior to another point in the past (achieving success on the fourth try)."},{"i":2,"focus":"was awarded to SpaceX by NASA","title":"Passive Voice Construction","note":"The passive form 'was awarded' highlights the contract as the subject receiving the action, while the performer 'by NASA' appears at the end."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Late in 2008, Elon Musk was struggling to preserve two innovative companies that were rapidly running out of money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","S","V","V","V","V","M","M"],"dur":8.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":9.3,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.56,2.1,2.28,2.68,3.0,3.5,3.78,4.08,4.62,5.18,5.78,6.18,6.34,6.82,7.22,7.44,7.54]},{"text":"His aerospace firm, SpaceX, suffered three consecutive launch failures that threatened to destroy the fledgling business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.7,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.09,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.3,1.4,2.36,2.66,3.08,3.8,4.16,4.64,5.06,5.32,5.68,6.22,6.52,6.8]},{"text":"Relief arrived in September when a fourth rocket reached Earth orbit, convincing NASA to offer crucial financial backing.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","V","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.41,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.62,0.96,1.42,2.1,2.18,2.46,2.86,3.36,3.66,4.42,4.72,5.22,5.6,5.78,6.26,7.0]},{"text":"In December 2008, the space agency awarded SpaceX a commercial deal worth $1.6 billion to fund future supply missions.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":10.98,"times":[0.0,0.56,0.56,1.88,1.98,2.16,2.64,3.14,3.52,4.04,4.3,4.98,5.73,6.36,6.94,7.84,8.04,8.42,8.82]},{"text":"Simultaneously, electric automaker Tesla faced severe liquidity problems as operational costs vastly exceeded available funding.","voice":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-saved/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","S","S","M","V","O","O"],"dur":8.85,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-20-markets-christmas-eve-funding-sav